  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic and spicy taco seasoning until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65bb44cb03a5929119520397-39bb5d2c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When rice has 10 mins remaining, finely chop cucumber and tomato.\n• In a medium bowl, combine cucumber, tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65bb44cb03a5929119520397-edc04f55.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side.\n• Remove from heat, add honey and a splash of water, and turn to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65bb44cb03a5929119520397-748f1ff3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide spiced rice between bowls. Top with haloumi and cucumber salsa. Drizzle with garlic aioli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65bb44cb03a5929119520397-85e38c75.jpeg"
    }
  ]
